data: {"id": "989ae6d5b4ec4be2-thinking-layer-234", "run_id": "989ae6d5b4ec4be2", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_token", "tool_name": null, "content": "\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789124167404}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "989ae6d5b4ec4be2-thinking-layer-235", "run_id": "989ae6d5b4ec4be2", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod `aiops-case-v05/workload` 处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，这通常意味着容器正在初始化但尚未就绪。为了确定具体原因（如镜像拉取失败、卷挂载问题或运行时配置错误），我需要根据其状态特征匹配相应的 Runbook。\n\n鉴于其状态为 `ContainerCreating`，且没有明确的 `ImagePullBackOff` 或 `CrashLoopBackOff`，最相关的诊断方向可能涉及卷挂载或运行时沙箱创建。我将首先获取 `pod-volume-mount-failed.md` (针对 Pending/ContainerCreating 且卷绑定/挂载失败) 和 `pod-sandbox-create-failed.md` (针对沙箱创建失败) 作为候选。考虑到 `ContainerCreating` 最常见于镜像拉取或卷绑定，我先获取卷挂载相关的 Runbook 进行排查。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789124167901}

