data: {"id": "989ae6d5b4ec4be2-final", "run_id": "989ae6d5b4ec4be2", "seq": 1115, "ts_ms": 1789124215173, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod volume 'input' references a ConfigMap key 'unavailable-key' that does not exist in ConfigMap 'workload-input', causing FailedMount and preventing the container from starting. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `ContainersReady=False`: \"containers with unready status: [app]\" (fact-6b525ffe665d) | 确认 Pod 处于非健康状态，且无法就绪 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `Container status`: `waiting_reason=\"ContainerCreating\"` (fact-9959842fd020) | 标识容器处于初始化挂载阶段，尚未进入运行态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `resource_request.memory=\"8Mi\"` / `memory_limit=\"32Mi\"` (fact-4b88251d1f52, fact-ad2e895b0ff5) | 资源配置极低，但重启计数为 0 (fact-2e01a26045b3)，排除 OOMKilled 导致反复拉起的可能 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (labels: container=\"app\", reason=\"ContainerCreating\") (fact-bbaf3ae5774d) | 独立指标确认等待原因为 ContainerCreating，与 K8s 状态吻合 |\n\nKubernetes 状态 (事实 1, 2) 与 Prometheus 指标 (事实 4) 共同证实了容器因挂载问题处于等待状态。由于日志与 Tracing 维度明确标注为 `not_applicable`（容器未启动，无流量产生），无法提供应用层面的进一步定位证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap key 引用错误 (Unavailable Key) → FailedMount 机制 → 容器状态等待挂载 (ContainerCreating) → Pod 保持 Pending 状态，应用不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod 卷 'input' 配置中引用了 ConfigMap 'workload-input' 中不存在的 key 'unavailable-key'。\n该挂载错误导致 Pod 启动流程受阻于 FailedMount 阶段，进而表现为 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 1, 2, 4）。\n\n*注：虽然 K8s 诊断器在 `diagnostic_status` 中标记为已诊断，但在本报告的校验流程中，事实源中并未包含直接展示 ConfigMap 缺失或 VolumeMount 错误的 K8s Event/State 记录，仅提供了容器状态和资源配置。因此，该结论主要依赖 K8s 状态和指标的联合观测（证据 1, 4）。*\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 52.9s\n├─ 问题定位: 20.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 23.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 23.8s (Evidence 19.2s, RCA 4.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 52.879, "metrics": {"run_id": "989ae6d5b4ec4be2", "mttr": {"value": "52.9s", "seconds": 52.88532209396362, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 52885.32209396362, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 49915.21096229553, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6889.100790023804, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2694.072961807251}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位